  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">(61 im&aacute;genes) La 11&ordf; Ruta de la Tapa retoma este jueves su &uacute;ltimo fin de semana largo, hasta el domingo 5 de diciembre, pero ahora en 15 de&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">los 16 locales de Hosturionda participantes, ya que Com a Casa estar&aacute; cerrado estos d&iacute;as</span><span style=\"color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">.</span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/rutadelatapados2021/agendarutadelatapalocals.jpg\" alt=\"agendarutadelatapalocals\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/rutadelatapados2021/img_20211121_134909.jpg\" alt=\"img_20211121_134909\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/rutadelatapados2021/img_20211121_135016.jpg\" alt=\"img_20211121_135016\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/rutadelatapados2021/img_20211121_135216.jpg\" alt=\"img_20211121_135216\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/rutadelatapados2021/img_20211121_135217.jpg\" alt=\"img_20211121_135217\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/rutadelatapados2021/img_20211126_195850.jpg\" alt=\"img_20211126_195850\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/rutadelatapados2021/img_20211126_200002.jpg\" alt=\"img_20211126_200002\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/rutadelatapados2021/img_20211126_200140.jpg\" alt=\"img_2021